    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Matrix in place - transpose + reverse</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/rotate-image/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 48</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Rotate Image</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A 90° clockwise turn sends cell (r, c) to (c, n-1-r). Split that move into two mirror images you can do in place with swaps: transpose ((r, c) -&gt; (c, r)), then reverse every row ((c, r) -&gt; (c, n-1-r)). O(n²) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
